#: patterns/data-policy.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Data processing policy"
msgstr ""

msgid "Demo site: Chivabox Movers is a fictional company, and this policy is a sample."
msgstr ""

msgid "Who is responsible: Chivabox Movers, Barranquilla, Colombia."
msgstr ""

msgid "What we collect: your name, phone, email, and the details of your move, when you ask for a quote."
msgstr ""

msgid "Why: to prepare your estimate, contact you about your move, and keep a record of your request. We don't sell your data or use it for advertising."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your rights: under Colombia's Law 1581 of 2012 you can see, correct or delete your data, and withdraw your consent, by writing to us from the email address you used."
msgstr ""

msgid "How long: we keep a request for as long as we need it to answer you and to meet our legal obligations."
msgstr ""

